---
import {getImage} from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SpatialPlate from '../components/spatial/SpatialPlate.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import SaveButton from '../components/experiments/SaveButton.astro';
import {photos} from '../lib/photos';
import {url} from '../lib/urls';
import '../styles/spatial.css';
const photograph=await getImage({src:photos.ybor,width:1280,format:'webp',quality:85});
const stops=[['drawing','01','The drawing'],['threshold','02','The threshold'],['corridor','03','The corridor'],['city','04','The city']];
---
<BaseLayout title="The unfinished city" description="Step inside an unfinished drawing of Tampa. A folding architectural world, a mechanical doorway, an impossible corridor, and a city found in the lines." edition="spatial">
<div class="spatial-topline"><a href={url('experiments/')}>← The experiment room</a><span>AN UNFINISHED STUDY / TAMPA, FLORIDA</span><a href="#field-notes">Read the field notes ↘</a></div>
<header class="spatial-intro"><div><span class="spatial-eyebrow">TAMPA CURATED / SPATIAL STUDY NO. 01</span><h1>The unfinished<br/><em>city.</em></h1></div><div class="spatial-intro-note"><p>Some places have to be<br/> imagined before they can be found.</p><span>A passage through paper, machinery,<br/> and the city between the lines.</span><a href="#drawing" data-room-link="drawing">Step inside the drawing ↓</a></div></header>
<section class="spatial-journey" data-spatial-root data-photo={photograph.src} aria-label="Journey through the unfinished city">
 <nav class="spatial-room-nav" aria-label="Rooms in the unfinished city">{stops.map(([id,n,title])=><a href={`#${id}`} data-room-link={id}><span>{n}</span>{title}</a>)}<button data-static-toggle type="button" hidden>Read without motion</button></nav>
 <div class="spatial-track" data-spatial-track>
  <div class="spatial-stage" data-spatial-stage>
   <div class="spatial-fallback"><SpatialPlate/></div>
   <div class="spatial-canvas" data-spatial-canvas aria-hidden="true"></div>
   <div class="spatial-stage-heading"><span>TC / THE UNFINISHED CITY</span><span data-world-coordinates>PLATE 01 — A PLACE IN THE MAKING</span></div>
   <nav class="spatial-stage-nav" aria-label="Jump to a room" data-stage-nav hidden>{stops.map(([id,n,title])=><a href={`#${id}`} data-room-link={id} aria-label={title}>{n}<span>{title}</span></a>)}</nav>
   <div class="spatial-pencil-note" data-pencil-note>leave room<br/> for the unexpected.</div>
   <a class="spatial-photo-link" data-photo-link href={url('stories/the-city-now/?from=unfinished-city')} hidden><span>YBOR CITY / A STUDY</span>Enter the photograph ↗</a>
   <div class="spatial-caption"><span data-room-number>01 / THE DRAWING</span><h2 data-room-heading>A place in the making.</h2><p data-room-copy>Lines become walls. A wheel becomes a way through. There is a city somewhere inside this drawing.</p></div>
   <div class="spatial-instruments" data-spatial-instruments hidden>
    <label class="spatial-crank" data-crank-label><span class="crank-face" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span><span>Turn the crank<input data-crank type="range" min="0" max="100" value="0" aria-label="Turn the crank to unfold the threshold"/></span></label>
    <button type="button" data-show-drawing hidden aria-pressed="false">See the drawing beneath</button>
    <a href="#field-notes">Leave the passage ↘</a>
   </div>
   <div class="spatial-progress" data-spatial-progress hidden><span></span></div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <p class="spatial-mode-message" data-spatial-message role="status">Scroll to explore, or use the four room links. The field notes are always available below.</p>
 <button type="button" class="spatial-retry" data-spatial-retry hidden>Try the moving drawing</button>
</section>
<section class="spatial-fieldnotes" id="field-notes" aria-labelledby="fieldnotes-title">
 <header><span class="spatial-eyebrow">OUT OF THE DRAWING / INTO THE CITY</span><h2 id="fieldnotes-title">Leave some things<br/><em>unfinished.</em></h2><p>An imaginary passage, with a real place at its end. These are the notes left on the drawing table.</p></header>
 <div class="spatial-notes-grid">
  <article id="drawing"><span>01 / THE DRAWING</span><h3>Before there are walls.</h3><p>A few lines on a sheet of paper. The parts have not yet agreed on their dimensions. Turn the crank and watch the drawing find its depth.</p><a href="#drawing" data-room-link="drawing">Return to the drawing ↗</a></article>
  <article id="threshold"><span>02 / THE THRESHOLD</span><h3>A wheel. A way through.</h3><p>The large gear carries a circular opening. Its smaller partner turns in the opposite direction. The doors unfold into a passage larger than the drawing first suggested.</p><a href="#threshold" data-room-link="threshold">Approach the doorway ↗</a></article>
  <article id="corridor"><span>03 / THE CORRIDOR</span><h3>Follow the wrong turn.</h3><p>An arcade of interrupted lines. A pulley lifts a panel as its counterweight descends. At the far end, the path turns left; the room you thought you understood opens into another.</p><a href="#corridor" data-room-link="corridor">Find the turn ↗</a></article>
  <article id="city"><span>04 / THE CITY</span><h3>You know these silhouettes.</h3><p>Pass Tampa Theatre on your left and Plant Hall on your right. Continue toward the Floridan and Rivergate Tower, past storefronts, shaded balconies, and palms. Brick crossings, bicycles, and worn pavement give the street its everyday rhythm.</p><p>Four real landmarks redrawn in loose ink, with touches of blue, brick red, and palm green. Their details come from the buildings; the surrounding streetscape and this walkable arrangement belong to the sketchbook. A photographic study of Ybor City waits beyond the street.</p><a href={url('neighborhoods/ybor-city/')}>Walk through Ybor City ↗</a></article>
 </div>
 <div class="spatial-story"><figure><a href={url('stories/the-city-now/?from=unfinished-city')}><Photo name="ybor" alt="Windows and brickwork of the Ybor Factory Building" treatment="mono" sizes="(max-width:700px) 90vw, 60vw"/></a><figcaption>Ybor Factory Building · Ikuna / Unsplash. <a href={url('credits/')}>Photography credits ↗</a></figcaption></figure><div><span class="spatial-eyebrow">A STORY TO COME BACK TO</span><h2>The city now.</h2><p>A city is a collection of small things. An opening essay about looking a little closer.</p><p class="spatial-disclosure">Sample editorial from the demonstration edition.</p><a class="spatial-story-link" href={url('stories/the-city-now/?from=unfinished-city')}>Read the story ⟶</a><SaveButton id="stories:the-city-now" title="The city now"/></div></div>
 <footer><span>THE DRAWING REMAINS OPEN.</span><a href={url('experiments/notebook/')}>Keep something in your notebook ↗</a><a href={url()}>Return to Tampa Curated ↗</a></footer>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
<script>import '../scripts/spatial/index';</script>
